    雇 | gù | hire; employ | Has 隹 (bird) inside 户 instead of 羽
    戾 | lì | contrary; perverse | Has 犬 (dog) inside 户 instead of 羽
    启 | qǐ | open; start; enlighten | Has 口 inside 户 instead of 羽
