    翩 | piān | flutter lightly; fly gracefully

semantic_boundary_contrasts:
  core_nuance: 扇子 is the standard handheld cooling implement, distinguished from mechanized electric fans.
  contrasts[3]{id,compared_word,pinyin,analysis}:
    1 | 扇子 vs. 电风扇 | diànfēngshàn | 扇子 is a manual, handheld fan made of bamboo, paper, or silk, whereas 电风扇 is an electrical motor-driven rotary appliance.
    2 | 扇子 vs. 团扇 | tuánshàn | 扇子 is the general umbrella noun, while 团扇 specifies a traditional circular, rigid silk fan favored by ancient palace ladies.
    3 | 扇子 vs. 折扇 | zhéshàn | 扇子 covers all fan typologies, whereas 折扇 refers specifically to the accordion-folding fan invented for portability.

extended_reading_passages[2]{id,hanzi,pinyin,en,es}:
  #1 | 一柄轻巧的竹骨折扇，不仅是夏日驱赶暑热的实用器物，更是承载文人雅趣的艺术珍品。名家在扇面上题诗作画，摇曳间清风徐来，散发着淡淡的墨香，在方寸之间尽显东方古典审美的从容与洒脱。 | Yì bǐng qīngqiǎo de zhúgǔ zhéshàn, bùjǐn shì xiàrì qūgǎn shǔrè de shíyòng qìwù, gèng shì chéngzài wénrén yǎqù de yìshù zhēnpǐn. Míngjiā zài shànmiàn shàng tíshī-zuòhuà, yáoyè jiān qīngfēng xúlái, sànfà zhe dàndàn de mòxiāng, zài fāngcùn zhījiān jìnxiǎn dōngfāng gǔdiǎn shěnměi de cóngróng yǔ sǎtuō. | A nimble bamboo folding fan is not merely a practical utensil dispelling summer heat, but an artistic treasure carrying literati poise. Master painters brush poetry and landscapes on its silk; waving it brings gentle breezes and ink fragrances, showing classical oriental aesthetics. | Un grácil abanico plegable de varillas de bambú trasciende su utilidad para combatir el bochorno, erigiéndose en joya artística de la estética letrada. Maestros de la caligrafía ilustran sus varillajes, trayendo en cada vaivén aromas a tinta y la serena soltura del arte oriental.
  #2 | 在传统非物质文化遗产传承中，手工制扇工艺凝聚了选竹、排骨、糊面等数十道精细工序。年轻一代手艺人将现代极简设计融入古老扇艺，使历经千年的传统扇子在当代生活美学中重新焕发出蓬勃生机。 | Zài chuántǒng fēiwùzhì wénhuà yíchǎn chuánchéng zhōng, shǒugōng zhìshàn gōngyì níngjù le xuǎnzhú, páigǔ, húmiàn děng shùshí dào jīngxì gōngxù. Niánqīng yídài shǒuyìrén jiāng xiàndài jíjiǎn shèjì róngrù gǔlǎo shànyì, shǐ lìjīng qiānnián de chuántǒng shànzi zài dāngdài shēnghuó měixué zhōng chóngxīn huànfā chū péngbó shēngjī. | In intangible cultural heritage preservation, crafting artisanal fans crystallizes dozens of meticulous steps like selecting bamboo and mounting paper. Young artisans infuse minimalist modern designs, revitalizing thousand-year-old traditional fans in contemporary lifestyle aesthetics. | En la salvaguardia del patrimonio inmaterial, la confección artesanal de abanicos condensa decenas de primorosas fases, desde la selección del bambú hasta el entelado. Nuevas generaciones de artífices fusionan diseño minimalista y tradición milenaria, insuflándoles renovada vitalidad.
